    "text": "<p>Match List - I with List - II.</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-I</strong></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-II</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>A</td>\t\t\t<td>Lyophilic colloid</td>\t\t\t<td>I</td>\t\t\t<td>Liquid-liquid colloid</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>B</td>\t\t\t<td>Emulsion</td>\t\t\t<td>II</td>\t\t\t<td>Protective colloid</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>C</td>\t\t\t<td>Positively charged colloid</td>\t\t\t<td>III</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>FeCl</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>NaOH</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>D</td>\t\t\t<td>Negatively charged colloid</td>\t\t\t<td>IV</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>FeCl</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo></math> hot water</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below</p>",
